alized per document; ack after write; gaps allowed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": "L39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u041a\u043b\u0438\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0441\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 lastSeq = max(seq); \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0440\u044f\u0434\u043a\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u043b\u043e \u0431\u044b \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0435"}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_subscribe_before_push", "label": "Subscribe before first push", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": "L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u0418\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435 lastSeq = max(ack) \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0447\u0443\u0436\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0448\u0435\u0434\u0448\u0438\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435"}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_guest_device_id", "label": "Guest device id: guest:<22-char hash> (fits 64-char limit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": "L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_no_echo_own_updates", "label": "Server does not echo client's own updates (except catch-up updates from another device)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": "L43", "source_url": null, "captured